# Security Rules

- Strict air-gapped offline operation. Zero remote HTTP/WS network requests permitted.
- Content Security Policy (CSP) restricts default-src to 'self'.
- Mandatory SHA-256 payload hash verification before saving files to disk.
- Received binary executable payloads must never be auto-executed.
